# Where the outside pieces of the rigs live on this machine (lrvne's rigs/README.md). An engine
# copies this file to its tests/rig.conf (keep it out of version control: it names this
# machine's paths) and sets what it has. One KEY=value per line, no quotes, no comments after a
# value; a leading ~/ is the home directory. Variables set in the environment win over the
# file; RIG_CONF=path reads another file instead.

# --- WinUAE (rigs/winuae) ---
# The emulator's tree: the WinUAE binary (WINUAE, default obj-winuae/winuae below it), the
# Kickstart ROM (rom/kick40068.A1200), AHI (aos/ahi/), the run work dirs (aos/work/rig/).
#EMU=~/amiga-emu
# A Workbench 3.1 tree with Picasso96 installed (read only; runs copy what they need).
#WBDISK=/path/to/workbench
# Other WinUAE binary, Kickstart image, work directory:
#WINUAE=~/amiga-emu/obj-winuae-sdl3/winuae
#KICKSTART=~/amiga-emu/rom/kick40068.A1200
#RIG_WORKTOP=~/amiga-emu/aos/work/rig

# --- WarpOS in WinUAE's Blizzard PPC (rigs/winuae/run-wos.sh) ---
#WINUAE_PPC=~/amiga-emu/obj-winuae-ppc/winuae
#WARPUP=/path/to/WarpUP-5.1
#BPPC_ROM=~/amiga-emu/rom/blizzardppc_060_44.71.rom

# --- AROS (rigs/aros) ---
# hosted/, native/ and contrib/ hold the unpacked 2026.09 releases.
#AROS_DIR=/path/to/aros
# Single paths, if they are elsewhere (the defaults below AROS_DIR):
#AROS_HOSTED=/path/to/aros/hosted/AROS-202609-linux-x86_64-system
#AROS_ISO=/path/to/aros/native/AROS-202609-pc-x86_64-boot-iso/aros-pc-x86_64.iso
#CONTRIB=/path/to/aros/contrib/AROS-202609-any-x86_64-contrib
